			<h6 style="text-align:center;">Christmas Center Employment Opportunities</h6>
			<p style="font-weight: 700">The Salvation Army needs several employees for short-term seasonal employment as part of our Christmas assistance team. Our Angel Tree program will run from Oct. 6 to Dec. 22 and will require several full-time employees to fill these temporary roles. Salaries range from $15-$17 per hour. Last year we provided Christmas assistance to over 3,500 children and 1,300 seniors in the Charlotte community. If you have a passion for serving others and enjoy the hustle and bustle of Christmas, please apply below for consideration. Interviews will be conducted the week of September 14th and 21st. NOTE: these roles are full-time with daily hours from 8:30 – 4:30 and some Saturday and evening work required.</p>
			<hr>
			<div class="row my-3">
				<div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-12">
					<div class="pvlRichtext" style="text-align:left"><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;"><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Christmas Center Senior Coordinator (Full Season)</strong></span></p>
<ul>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;">Must have strong leadership, management, and organizational skills</li>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;">Excellent communication and problem-solving abilities</li>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;">Proficient in Word, Excel, and database programs</li>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;">Ability to handle stress and manage multiple tasks</li>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;">Supervises staff in the&nbsp;absence of the Christmas Services Manager</li>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;">Assists with daily operations, client registration, and other assigned tasks</li>
</ul>
<p><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://www.paycomonline.net/v4/ats/web.php/portal/28809B62A74C684488AE486A18412AA4/jobs/124677">Apply for Coordinator Position</a></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;"></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;"><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Volunteer Coordinator (Full Season)</strong></span></p>
<ul>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;">Outgoing personality; comfortable speaking to large groups</li>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;">Strong communication and organizational skills</li>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;">Proficient in online database programs</li>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;">Responsible for scheduling, training, and supervising volunteers</li>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;">Supports client registration and additional seasonal tasks</li>
</ul>
<p><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://www.paycomonline.net/v4/ats/web.php/portal/28809B62A74C684488AE486A18412AA4/jobs/124677">Apply for Coordinator Position</a></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;"></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;"><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Bi-Lingual Communication Coordinator (Full Season)</strong></span></p>
<ul>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;">Must be fluent in Spanish and English</li>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;">Provides translation support and communication with Hispanic clients</li>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;">Assists with volunteer coordination and registration tasks</li>
</ul>
<p><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://www.paycomonline.net/v4/ats/web.php/portal/28809B62A74C684488AE486A18412AA4/jobs/124677">Apply for Coordinator Position</a></p></div>
				</div>
				<div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-12">
					<div class="pvlRichtext" style="text-align:left"><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;"><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Donor / Special Handling Coordinator (Full Season)</strong></span></p>
<ul>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;">Strong computer and organizational skills, must have strong excel skills</li>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;">Manages donor communication and Angel Tree assignments</li>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;">Coordinates preparation and pick-up of Angel orders</li>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;">Oversees check-in and placement of special handling items</li>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left;">Supports client registration as needed</li>
</ul>
